<!--
  Nothing is set here, on purpose. This file is a fence.

  MSBuild looks for a file of this name in a project's own folder and then in each
  folder above it, and uses the first it finds. The new Windows app has one in the
  folder above (../Directory.Build.props) with settings for its own projects. Without
  this file those settings would reach the first editor's project too, which was never
  written for them. With it, that project builds as it did when it was moved here.
-->
<Project>
</Project>
